es":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"vNUEotvnUX--fUfGWhivGQ","review_id":"ANYEtZrt8_GKJZuMvf_P_A","date":"2020-12-28T20:54:13","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.949711799621582,"text_excerpt":"C'est bon! Very good, local seafood spot. When we got there, I was going to get the poboy combo with a pound of crawfish. But they were sold out of poboy bread and crawfish. I am glad they were. Instead I got a half pound of shrimp (their last one) and two pounds of male blue crabs, corn, potatoes and sausage. All were very tasty. Nice spice to the boil. Messy delicious meal."},{"business_id":"vNUEotvnUX--fUfGWhivGQ","review_id":"-ktHFwPuBj6-xFdf_-ubig","date":"2016-06-01T15:54:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9450916647911072,"text_excerpt":"I love Bevi Seafood. I go here a lot and never disappointed with any of my food choices. I love the seafood platter but their catfish po'boy is also very delicious. With the seafood platter you can expect it to come with shrimp, catfish, oysters, fries and potato salad. It's actually a pretty good portion and most importantly they don't give you tiny oysters!!! The catfish po'boy is just delicious on nice soft french bread with just the right amount of crisp on the freshly fried fish. Also another surprise, I'm sure you would assume that they would have very weak and expensive crawfish....but DEFINITELY NOT THE CASE. I have never paid more than $3/lb for their crawfish and it is always fl..."},{"business_id":"vNUEotvnUX--fUfGWhivGQ","review_id":"FtgxQDs11tRb2NHQuY5C1w","date":"2016-04-23T23:05:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9405813217163086,"text_excerpt":"I was craving gumbo as we drove by this place. We went in to check it out and I decided on a shrimp poboy and a bowl of gumbo. Yummo!!! The shrimp was huge and fresh. I don't usually care for French bread with sesame seeds on top but it was so good, I didn't mind. The gumbo was delicious. We liked the vibe of the place. Boiled seafood looked delicious and beer on tap. We'll be back for a few pounds of boiled crawfish. The prices were decent too. :) Nothing fancy. Just good food."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"vNUEotvnUX--fUfGWhivGQ","photo_id":"HTrsrFSx8f16_U8wWPeD8A","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/HTrsrFSx8f16_U8wWPeD8A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8901415467262268},{"business_id":"vNUEotvnUX--fUfGWhivGQ","photo_id":"kNGZMkPSedcwCwwyTY_wuQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/kNGZMkPSedcwCwwyTY_wuQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8881294131278992},{"business_id":"vNUEotvnUX--fUfGWhivGQ","photo_id":"4DWerlYXd_PXFELWkEv9Vw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/4DWerlYXd_PXFELWkEv9Vw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8771731853485107},{"business_id":"vNUEotvnUX--fUfGWhivGQ","photo_id":"BnQlJJ6AtCmej_VOKuiMzQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/BnQlJJ6AtCmej_VOKuiMzQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8230171203613281},{"business_id":"vNUEotvnUX--fUfGWhivGQ","photo_id":"c-YHlI6gSDiJ9